==English==

===Verb===
'''to [[sell]] like [[hotcake|hot cake]]s'''

# {{intransitive|idiomatic}} To sell fast.  
#: ''During a power outtage, candles '''sell like hot cakes'''.''
# {{idiomatic}} To be distributed quickly.
#: ''At the family reunion my father's hamburgers '''sold like hotcakes'''.''

====Conjugation====
* Conjugated in the same way as ''[[sell]]''.

